From: web-slicer <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] FillConcentricInternal: value-initialize WallToolPathsParams

Arachne::WallToolPathsParams is an aggregate without default member
initializers. FillConcentricInternal only sets a subset of its fields, so
min_length_factor and is_top_or_bottom_layer were read uninitialized
(reported by Valgrind), making G-code output non-deterministic.
Value-initialization ({}) zeroes them: min_length_factor = 0,
is_top_or_bottom_layer = false.

--- a/src/libslic3r/Fill/FillConcentricInternal.cpp
+++ b/src/libslic3r/Fill/FillConcentricInternal.cpp
@@ -28,5 +28,5 @@
         double min_nozzle_diameter = *std::min_element(print_config->nozzle_diameter.values.begin(), print_config->nozzle_diameter.values.end());
-        Arachne::WallToolPathsParams input_params;
+        Arachne::WallToolPathsParams input_params{};
         input_params.min_bead_width = 0.85 * min_nozzle_diameter;
         input_params.min_feature_size = 0.25 * min_nozzle_diameter;
         input_params.wall_transition_length = 0.4;
